Live Lift NDJSON Format
Each line in lifts/{YYYY-MM-DD}.ndjson:


{"timestamp":"2026-01-10T15:33:32.814Z","localTime":"08:33","resort":"vail","liftId":"15","name":"Avanti Express #2","status":"Open","waitMinutes":1,"type":"Six Pack"}
Key API Endpoints
Endpoint	Description
/data/{resort}/lifts/index.json	Latest lifts for resort
/data/{resort}/lifts/{date}.ndjson	Historical lift data
/data/latest-lifts.json	All resorts latest lifts
/data/{resort}/snow/latest.json	Latest snow report
/data/{resort}/terrain/latest.json	Latest grooming
Update frequency: Lift data every 1-2.5 min, snow every 30 min, terrain once daily.